{
  "declaredLength": 3544,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位就是皙白先生的劲敌\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D5C31662F7699767D5148751F768452B2654C000A001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0554AFF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我总是会听到你的传言。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211603B662F4F1A542C52304F6076844F208A00300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我叫裘投，\n钟爱的宝可梦是投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EB88D86295FF0C000A949F723176845B9D53EF68A6662F629564549B3C300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！竟然被你抢先了！\n你这个投摔鬼爱好者就是狡猾！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF017ADF713688AB4F6062A251484E86FF01000A4F608FD94E2A629564549B3C7231597D80055C31662F72E1733EFF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我叫斐打，\n打击鬼这种宝可梦是我的至爱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EB65906253FF0C000A625351FB9B3C8FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6662F6211768481F37231300200100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n请听我说明一下状况。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8BF7542C62118BF4660E4E004E0B72B651B5300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这两位分别是\n打击鬼和投摔鬼的爱好者。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E244F4D5206522B662F000A625351FB9B3C548C629564549B3C76847231597D8005300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他们正要通过对战\n决出哪边的宝可梦更强。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED64EEC6B638981901A8FC75BF96218000A51B351FA54EA8FB976845B9D53EF68A666F45F3A300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实我正在找第5个成员，\n希望<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐你能帮个忙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E62116B635728627E7B2C00354E2A62105458FF0C000A5E0C671B001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D04F6080FD5E2E4E2A5FD9FF0100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！又被你抢先了！\n你这个投摔鬼爱好者就是让人防不胜防！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0153C888AB4F6062A251484E86FF01000A4F608FD94E2A629564549B3C7231597D80055C31662F8BA94EBA96324E0D80DC9632FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要知道我的队伍\n也正在找第5个成员呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898177E5905362117684961F4F0D000A4E5F6B635728627E7B2C00354E2A621054585440FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你们两个都冷静一点。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F604EEC4E244E2A90FD51B797594E0070B9300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你要助阵哪一边呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000300200100001BE01000A4F60898152A9963554EA4E008FB95462FF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐！\n请你一定要帮我们打击鬼部队！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF01000A8BF74F604E005B9A89815E2E62114EEC625351FB9B3C90E8961FFF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐！\n请你一定要加入我们投摔鬼部队。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF01000A8BF74F604E005B9A898152A0516562114EEC629564549B3C90E8961F300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请先只带上1只打击鬼或投摔鬼，\n再来找我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7514853EA5E264E0A003153EA625351FB9B3C6216629564549B3CFF0C000A518D6765627E62115427300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你带着的是打击鬼啊。\n那么，你要加入打击鬼部队吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E2677407684662F625351FB9B3C554A3002000A90A34E48FF0C4F60898152A05165625351FB9B3C90E8961F5417FF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你带着的是投摔鬼啊。\n那么，你要加入投摔鬼部队吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E2677407684662F629564549B3C554A3002000A90A34E48FF0C4F60898152A05165629564549B3C90E8961F5417FF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的！请仔细考虑一下\n再决定要加入哪边吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7684FF018BF74ED47EC6800386514E004E0B000A518D51B35B9A898152A0516554EA8FB95427300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "斐打，\n打击鬼部队要有帮手加入了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65906253FF0C000A625351FB9B3C90E8961F898167095E2E624B52A051654E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们胜券在握了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC80DC5238572863E14E86FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "裘投，\n投摔鬼部队要有帮手加入了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88D86295FF0C000A629564549B3C90E8961F898167095E2E624B52A051654E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能选择我们投摔鬼部队，\n让我荣幸之至！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD900962E962114EEC629564549B3C90E8961FFF0C000A8BA9621183635E784E4B81F3FF0100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，就来打一场打击鬼部队\n和投摔鬼部队的对决吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C5C31676562534E00573A625351FB9B3C90E8961F000A548C629564549B3C90E8961F76845BF951B35427FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我虽然不才，\n但请让我来当裁判。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211867D71364E0D624DFF0C000A4F468BF78BA9621167655F5388C15224300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请大家确认一下规则。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n双方的先锋、次锋、中坚、副将、主将\n分别依次对战，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n胜场数多的一方获胜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF759275BB6786E8BA44E004E0B89C45219300200100001BE01000A53CC65B976845148950B30016B21950B30014E2D575A3001526F5C0630014E3B5C06000A5206522B4F9D6B215BF96218FF0C00100001BE00000A80DC573A6570591A76844E0065B983B780DC300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，开始！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C5F0059CBFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先锋战，\n疾风打击鬼对神速投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5148950B6218FF0C000A75BE98CE625351FB9B3C5BF9795E901F629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一本！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00672CFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "获胜的是疾风打击鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83B780DC7684662F75BE98CE625351FB9B3CFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "次锋战，\n怒涛打击鬼对气势投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B21950B6218FF0C000A60126D9B625351FB9B3C5BF96C1452BF629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "两次技有！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E246B2162806709FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "获胜的是气势投摔鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83B780DC7684662F6C1452BF629564549B3CFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中坚战，\n不动打击鬼对腿技投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D575A6218FF0C000A4E0D52A8625351FB9B3C5BF9817F6280629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "技有！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62806709FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "获胜的是腿技投摔鬼！\n这下投摔鬼部队两胜一败了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83B780DC7684662F817F6280629564549B3CFF01000A8FD94E0B629564549B3C90E8961F4E2480DC4E008D254E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "副将战，\n必杀打击鬼对拆招投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "526F5C066218FF0C000A5FC56740625351FB9B3C5BF962C662DB629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一本！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00672CFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "获胜的是必杀打击鬼！\n这下两胜两败，双方五五开了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83B780DC7684662F5FC56740625351FB9B3CFF01000A8FD94E0B4E2480DC4E248D25FF0C53CC65B94E944E945F004E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "终于到了主将战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EC84E8E52304E864E3B5C066218300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "主将战，\n空降打击鬼对赤红投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3B5C066218FF0C000A7A7A964D625351FB9B3C5BF98D647EA2629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "主将战，\n青蓝打击鬼对空降投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
