      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不过，要是没有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n我们是赢不了的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n希望还能有机会领教打击鬼的厉害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C22FF0100100001BE01000A4E0D8FC7FF0C8981662F6CA16709001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A62114EEC662F8D624E0D4E867684300200100001BE00000A5E0C671B8FD880FD6709673A4F1A98866559625351FB9B3C768453895BB3300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抛开胜负互相称赞，\n这是货真价实的体育精神。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这正是武道的精神！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，干得漂亮！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "629B5F0080DC8D1F4E9276F879F08D5EFF0C000A8FD9662F8D27771F4EF75B9E76844F5380B27CBE795E300200100001BE01000A8FD96B63662F6B66905376847CBE795EFF01000A0010000201000000FF0C5E725F976F024EAEFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
